[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Kibana uses Elastic License 2.0 and requires Node.js 24.21.0 or newer in
major version 24. Reporting and screenshotting are disabled on MidnightBSD.

Configuration samples are installed in %%ETCDIR%%. Kibana-specific
utilities are linked into %%BINDIR%%. See %%WWWDIR%%/README.MidnightBSD
for the port's changes and upgrade requirements.
EOM
}
{ type: upgrade
  message: <<EOM
Upgrade Elasticsearch to 8.19.23 before starting Kibana. Stop all old
Kibana instances and take an Elasticsearch snapshot including the Kibana
feature state before the saved-object migration. Preserve configuration
and the Kibana data directory; reinstall third-party plugins for 8.19.23.

This port now declares Elastic License 2.0, correcting its former Apache
license metadata. Reporting and screenshotting remain disabled.
See %%WWWDIR%%/README.MidnightBSD for details.
EOM
}
]
